        <qualifiedname>sl_bt_evt_system_resource_exhausted_s::num_buffer_allocation_failures</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The system has run out of the pre-allocated data buffers that are allocated based on SL_BT_CONFIG_BUFFER_SIZE configuration and a buffer allocation has failed. </para>
